  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "初始引导\nAh, it's you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's been a long time since we've last seen each other.\nDuring this time... you've been teetering on the edge of a cliff."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You may have forgotten who you are, but just remembering your name is enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "...It's time. Don't linger here for too long.\nAfter all, you aren't my guest yet, nor should you even be here.\nShe still needs you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "December 23rd.\nYou may not remember what this date means to you.\nAnd this will thrust you into peril.\n......\nNo...\nYou must try to remember."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...consciousness..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Circulation resumed... vitals stabilized... cardioplegia solution injected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Body temperature low... administering Hexamethasone 20 c.c., now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get the hemostat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Conditions stable... beginning resection... be careful of VFib..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Sorry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Distant Voice",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "For making you suffer again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Doctor..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...hand!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take my..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Take my hand!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Emergency..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Help..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...It's done...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, Doctor!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Medic, how's Doctor doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But, just a moment ago... we were holding hands..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "So why... why is Doctor still not waking up...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Amiya! Don't panic, just calm down first!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Ah... S-sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "You always get so flustered when it comes to the doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "But, Amiya, if the worst came to pass... what would you do then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...I'm already mentally prepared for that. We would continue to follow the plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "...I understand. Anyway, I'll do what you requested."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "All right... I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "About the Doctor..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Don't worry, Amiya. All the vital signs are stable now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "I'll do one more inspection, just for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Thank you... Thank you very much!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Mhm. Breathing is slightly shallow, but blood pressure is normal. There should be no cause for concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Are you awake?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Amiya, it's a success! The Doctor has woken up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I'm so happy... Doctor..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Ah, careful! You mustn't do that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Don't try to move yet. Your body still hasn't fully adapted to this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Who... are you?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Ah, Doctor... It's me..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "It's me, Amiya."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We've come to rescue you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...Who... am I...?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "You..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "You're a member of Rhodes Island, just like us..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...as well as my partner."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "You're the most important person to me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor... you don't remember?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...Can I trust you?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "I understand. I know this is a bit much to take in right now."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "I don't expect you to remember everything right away, and I'm not asking you to trust me right now."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, do you really not remember me at all...?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Even if that's the case... I won't give up."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "We've already sacrificed so much, just to find you..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I see... Pleased to meet you, Amiya.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Ah, um, hello."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "..."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "I, I don't know how to put this, but so many things have changed from before."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "That includes me as well."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "However, you'll always be the most important person to me, Doctor. No matter what happens, this will never change."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "So that's why, please... give me a little more time."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "However little it might be..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Medic",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "Does the doctor... really have amnesia?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'm sure everything will be fine if we give Doctor some space..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Where is this...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "It's safe here—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Huh? What's happening—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "Amiya, we've got a problem!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "Someone broke into the facility!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "The way they're dressed... they don't look like Ursus soldiers!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "What's the meaning of this?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Heavily-Armed Man",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "They're attacking! Amiya, they're heavily equipped with weapons!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Medic",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "Aaaahh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Be careful, everyone! Take cover, and protect Doctor!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "These outfits... are they from the Reunion Movement? But how is that possible..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Guards, prepare for battle!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "Roger!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "Curses... Are they after the Doctor?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "No... Nobody else should know about the Doctor being here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Are you able to reach Kal'tsit?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "I'm not sure why, but the equipment isn't working!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...Someone has cut off our communications."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Have we been discovered by the Ursus government?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "What do we do now?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Kal'tsit won't be able to command the battle as we had originally planned."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I hope that... you'll be able to take command."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Medic",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "Isn't that a bit too risky? The Doctor only just came to..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'd like... to give it a try."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Even without memories, Doctor has..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...fought alongside us before."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Thank you for all of your guidance..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We've been through so much together..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor... I just know that you'll be able to do it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I know that you'll lead us to victory."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I understand that asking you to do this is very sudden and inconsiderate."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But... Please, lend us your aid."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We'll be supporting you!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Let's push them back first!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "We have no choice but to fight back, right?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Mm... I don't want to drag you into this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But right now, we need your wisdom more than ever, Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I hope that a part of you will reawaken during combat."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Even though you might have doubts about yourself..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But I believe in you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I know you can do this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Please take command... of Rhodes Island!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
